n visibility control to the `TreeItem`, allowing for hiding or showing individual cell contents without affecting the overall tree layout. This PR will help implement something like [#10911](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10911) in the future.\r\n\r\n#### Methods:\r\n```gdscript\r\nTreeItem.set_cell_visible(column: int, visible: bool) -> void:\r\nTreeItem.is_cell_visible(column: int) -> bool:\r\nTreeItem.set_button_visible(column: int, button_index: int, visible: bool) -> void:\r\nTreeItem.is_button_visible(column: int, button_index: int) -> bool:\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### Signal:\r\n```gdscript\r\nTree.item_hovered(item: TreeItem, column: int)\r\n```\r\nThe signal is the main part of implementing the cell visibility change, for example, hovering over a cell shows the button, etc.\r\n\r\n#### In Action:\r\n![GIF 2-5-2026 12-12-37 PM](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e8f3950a-87b0-44eb-9f24-c147c4762915)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https